  "description": "Confluence Flat Bar ESSA 8 is our light gravel ebike that makes it easier to squeeze more adventures into each day. Ride to the ride, tack on those bonus miles, explore all the spur roads, or bring your mid-ride coffee setup without worrying about weight.\n\nMAHLE’s X30 hub-drive motor is lightweight and discreet, with 45Nm of torque on tap for a confidence boost everywhere you ride. Confluence’s comfortable, stable geometry makes those extra miles and higher speeds feel natural.\n\nThree-Pack mounts, rack mounts, and fenders mounts make Confluence the best gravel ebike for adventure; suspension fork and dropper post compatibility plus 700c x 50mm tire clearance expands your capability to cover the roughest roads out there.\n\nThe Shimano ESSA 1 x 8 drivetrain keeps things simple and dependable, just what you want when you’re focused on riding farther.\n\nMeets UL 2849, and UL 2271 certification",
